abstract: "Continuous-time hidden multi-state model for health-care trajectories from linked administrative data, correcting for diagnostic misclassification and informative observation. Includes simulation study, synthetic ICES-style pipeline, temporal validation and budget plan. Synthetic data only."
keywords: [multi-state models, hidden Markov models, health administrative data, Bayesian, informative observation]
